## Folder Structure

```
src/<service_name>/
  controllers/                  # Domain orchestration
    <feature>.clj
  diplomat/
    http_server.clj             # Route registry (all routes merged here)
    http_server/
      <feature>.clj             # HTTP handler per feature
    http_client/
      <external_service>.clj    # One file per upstream service
    consumer.clj                # Kafka consumer handlers + settings
    producer.clj                # Kafka producer functions + settings
  db/
    datomic/
      <entity>.clj              # Datomic CRUD per entity
  adapters/
    <feature>.clj               # wire ↔ model translators
  wire/
    in/
      <feature>.clj             # Inbound schemas (loose-schema)
    out/
      <feature>.clj             # Outbound schemas (strict-schema)
    datomic/
      <entity>.clj              # DB schemas (strict-schema, namespaced keywords)
  models/
    <entity>.clj                # Domain schemas (strict-schema)
  logic/
    <domain>.clj                # Pure business rules
  config.clj                    # Config access functions
  server.clj                    # Component lifecycle / system startup

resources/
  <service>_config.json.base    # Service configuration (URLs, topics, etc.)

test/
  unit/<service_name>/
    adapters/
      <feature>_test.clj
    logic/
      <domain>_test.clj
    db/
      datomic/
        <entity>_test.clj       # Unit tests for DB functions (optional)
  integration/integration/
    <feature>_test.clj          # state-flow integration tests
    aux/
      request.clj               # HTTP request helpers
      <service_stub>.clj        # Stub responses for external services
      db/
        <entity>.clj            # DB helpers for integration tests
  shared/<service_name>/
    fixtures/
      <entity>.clj              # Reusable test fixtures
```

