## Kafka Consumer / Producer Pattern

```clojure
;; diplomat/consumer.clj
(s/defn card-event-handler
  [event  :- wire.in.card/CardEvent
   _meta
   {:keys [producer datomic]}]
  (-> (adapters.card/wire->model event)
      (controllers.card/process! producer datomic)))

(def settings
  {:card-event {:handler card-event-handler :schema wire.in.card/CardEvent}})
```

```clojure
;; diplomat/producer.clj
(s/defn card-updated!
  [card     :- models.card/Card
   producer :- protocols.producer/IProducer]
  (protocols.producer/produce!
    producer
    {:topic   :card-updated
     :message (adapters.card/model->wire card)}))

(def settings
  {:card-updated {:schema wire.out.card/CardUpdated :content-type :edn}})
```

