## Controller Pattern

```clojure
;; controllers/card_identify.clj
(ns better-call-saul.controllers.card-identify
  (:require [better-call-saul.diplomat.http-client.tremiliques :as http-client.tremiliques]
            [better-call-saul.models.card-identify              :as models.card-identify]
            [common-core.protocols.http-client                  :as protocols.http-client]
            [schema.core                                         :as s]))

;; Controllers receive models, pass models to diplomat.*, return models.
;; They never call adapter functions directly.
(s/defn identify! :- models.card-identify/ProtoCard
  [request :- models.card-identify/IdentifyRequest
   http    :- protocols.http-client/IHttpClient]
  (http-client.tremiliques/identify-card! request http))
```

