## Logic Pattern

```clojure
;; logic/card_summaries.clj
;; Pure functions only — no I/O, no side effects, no component deps.
(s/defn card-ids-from-summaries :- [s/Uuid]
  [summaries :- [models.card-summaries/CardSummary]]
  (mapv :card-id summaries))

(s/defn insert-skins-in-card-summaries :- [models.card-summaries/CardSummary]
  [summaries    :- [models.card-summaries/CardSummary]
   skin-by-id   :- {s/Uuid models.card-skin/Skin}]
  (map #(assoc % :skin (get skin-by-id (:card-id %))) summaries))
```

